From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shayne <8741557+shaynelegault@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:15:35 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] mtd: apple-sftl: Account for native flash provider events

Reproduce the measured VFL and lower-provider counters from an explicit
initial state and a complete stream of requests and completions. Track
row counts, scatter requests, single-block erase and synchronization.
Refuse a statistics sample when its event history is incomplete.

Exercise both buffers at their native widths, including counter rollover.
Keep physical provider registration disabled.

Assisted-by: LLM
